OL,3,GNEWSARoad to stay shut after oil spill
OL,4,Adamage
OL,5,
OL,6,FResurfacing works are due to begin on a
OL,7,FKent A-road after an oil spill left
OL,8,Fpart of it unsafe to reopen.
OL,10,FInspections confirmed resurfacing was
OL,11,Fneeded on a stretch of Peninsula Way
OL,12,Fnear Chattenden, between Main Road
OL,13,Froundabout and Dux Court roundabout,
OL,14,Fbefore the route could be brought back
OL,15,Finto use, Medway Council said.
OL,17,FWork is due to begin on Friday and is
OL,18,Fexpected to be completed by 27
OL,19,FNovember, with the site operating as a
OL,20,F24-hour manned work area throughout the
OL,21,Frepairs.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
